hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3961","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zulm teen qism ka hai: aik zulm jise Allah nahi bakhshega, aik zulm jise wo bakhsh dega aur aik zulm jise wo nahi chhorega. Raha wo zulm jise Allah nahi bakhshega to wo shirk hai; Allah ne farmaya: Beshak shirk bara zulm hai. Aur raha wo zulm jise wo bakhsh dega to wo bandon ka apne aap par zulm hai jo un ke aur un ke Rab ke darmiyan hai. Aur raha wo zulm jise Allah nahi chhorega to wo bandon ka aapas mein aik doosre par zulm hai yahan tak ke un mein se baaz ke liye baaz se badla liya jaye."
"3962","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Girwi rakhi hui sawari par us ke kharche ke badle sawari ki ja sakti hai jab wo girwi ho, aur doodh dene wale janwar ka doodh us ke kharche ke badle piya ja sakta hai jab wo girwi ho; aur jo sawari kare aur doodh piye us par kharcha hai."
